# storj-agent-backup — example offload candidates list.
#
# Copy to the path in CANDIDATES_FILE (default:
# ~/.config/storj-agent-backup/offload-candidates.txt), one absolute path
# per line. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Each listed path is copied to the offload bucket, verified with
# `rclone check --size-only`, and only then removed locally. Every
# removal is recorded in the manifest (offload-manifest.jsonl), and
# restore-from-storj.sh can bring it back.
#
# Examples (edit to your own bulky directories):
# /home/you/Downloads/old-installers
# /home/you/workspace/archived-datasets
